{"data": [{"author_id": "1977291220276957184", "created_at": "2026-11-17T05:31:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122563310642196634"], "id": "2122563310642196634", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 1155, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "每次用 Claude Code 和 Codex，账单和额度像流水一样烧，微软终于看不下去了！\n\n微软研究院联手伯克利刚开源了一个专治烧钱的核弹插件：TokenEconomizer\n\n不用改任何大模型底座，零侵入无脑外挂，在 SWE-bench 官方基准测试里，直接把 Token 消耗硬生生砍掉了 18.4% 到", "url": "https://x.com/mingzi206/status/2122563310642196634"}, {"author_id": "2027925365415677959", "created_at": "2026-11-17T03:07:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122527083830358188"], "id": "2122527083830358188", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1802, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "说一个冷知识：\n\nCodex、Claude Code、DeepSeek Harness 是免费的！\n\n都支持接入：GPT/Claude/Gemini/DeepSeek/GLM/Kimi/Grok/Qwen等AI大模型。\n\n但接入大模型需要你自己掏钱。", "url": "https://x.com/changchuan888/status/2122527083830358188"}, {"article": {"cover_media": "3_2122718327667830784", "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 9, "start": 0, "text": "DevTools"}, {"end": 17, "start": 10, "text": "GitHub"}, {"end": 29, "start": 18, "text": "ClaudeCode"}, {"end": 35, "start": 30, "text": "代码审查"}, {"end": 41, "start": 36, "text": "开源代码"}], "mentions": [{"end": 23, "start": 15, "username": "alibaba"}]}, "media_entities": ["3_2122719095158390784", "3_2122719153610174464", "3_2122719037331492864", "3_2122718900056141824", "3_2122718974219808768"], "plain_text": "AI 写代码越来越快，PR 越堆越多，审代码的人却没有变多。\n很多人干脆把 git diff 丢给大模型去审。结果是文件一多就漏看，指出的问题行号对不上，同一份代码每次审出来都不一样。\n别再这么干了。阿里把内部用了两年的 AI 代码审查工具开源了，叫 OpenCodeReview，GitHub 上已经有 5 万 Star。\n这篇讲清三件事：它凭什么比直接丢给大模型靠谱、4 条命令怎么跑起来、哪些地方别指望它。\n \n它是什么：一个帮你先过一遍的初审同事\nOpenCodeReview 是一个命令行工具。装好以后，在项目里敲 ocr review，它会读出你这次改了哪些代码，交给你指定的大模型去审，再把意见标到具体的某一行。\n它原本是阿里内部官方的 AI 代码审查助手。按官方的说法，两年里服务过几万名开发者，找出过几百万个代码缺陷。现在用 Apache 2.0 协议开源，免费。\n它凭什么更靠谱：死板的事交给程序，动脑的事交给 AI\n直接把 diff 丢给大模型，等于让 AI 自己决定看哪些文件、按什么标准查、问题标在哪一行。这三件事它都容易出错。\nOpenCodeReview 把这三件事收了回来，用写死的程序去做，只让 AI 负责判断代码有没有问题。\n三个毛病，它分别这么治：\n文件一多就漏看：程序先把要审的文件全部列出来、分好组，一组一组交给 AI。\n行号对不上：AI 给出意见后，程序再核对一遍位置，把它对到正确的那一行。\n每次结果不一样：检查清单是固定的规则，按文件类型自动配好，不靠临场发挥。\n \n内置的规则盯着四类老问题：空指针、线程安全、XSS、SQL 注入。团队也可以加自己的规则，比如「新方法必须校验参数是否为空」。\n效果上，官方给了两个数。和 Claude Code、Codex 这类通用编码助手比，审查质量的综合得分最高是对方的 2.17 倍。和 Claude Code 用同一个模型时，token 只要约九分之一。\n怎么用：4 条命令跑起来\n前提是电脑上有 Git（2.41 或更高）和 Node.js。\nnpm install -g @alibaba-group/open-code-review\nocr config provider\nocr config model\nocr review\n \n第 1 条是安装。第 2、3 条是选模型厂商和模型，跟着提示选就行，OpenAI 和 Anthropic 的接口都支持，也能填自己的接口地址。第 4 条开始审你还没提交的改动。\n想换个审法，再记三条：\nocr review --from main --to feature-branch\nocr review --commit abc123\nocr scan\n依次是：审一个分支相对 main 的改动、审某一次提交、不看改动把整份文件扫一遍。\n用熟了有三种接法：\n本地命令行：OpenCodeReview 自己调大模型，要配 API Key。适合提交前自己先审一遍。\n交给编码助手：用你已有的 Claude Code、Codex、Cursor 来调模型，不用另配 Key。适合已经在用这些工具的人。\n挂进 CI：在 CI 里跑 OpenCodeReview，要配 API Key。适合团队每个 PR 自动审。\n \n在 Claude Code 里装好它的插件后，输入 /open-code-review:delegate-review 就是第二种接法。CI 目前支持 GitHub Actions、GitLab CI 和 Gerrit\n \n特别需要注意的说明：\n它抓不全。 官方自己写明，它找出问题的比例比通用编码助手低，这是为了少报废话做的取舍。公开评测里，最好的配置也只找出约 20% 的已知问题。它是初审，人工审查不能省。\n效果数字是阿里自己的基准。 第三方的独立验证还很少。有人做过一次小规模独立测试，结果并不好，维护者说是工具调用异常并已修复。\n工具免费，模型不免费。 token 费用自己出。代码改动会发给你配置的那家模型厂商，公司代码先确认合规，或者接公司自己部署的模型。\nAI 负责写得快，也得有东西负责审得住。先让它过一遍，人再看重点，是眼下最省力的组合。\n你们团队现在的代码审查，是人审、AI 审，还是基本不审？评论区聊聊。\n#DevTools #GitHub #ClaudeCode #代码审查 #开源代码 ", "preview_text": "AI 写代码越来越快，PR 越堆越多，审代码的人却没有变多。\n很多人干脆把 git diff 丢给大模型去审。结果是文件一多就漏看，指出的问题行号对不上，同一份代码每次审出来都不一样。", "title": "牛逼！GitHub 上 5 万 Star  阿里用了两年的内部审查工具开源了！"}, "author_id": "1847963625325268992", "created_at": "2026-11-17T16:01:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122721758403022866"], "id": "2122721758403022866", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 326, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "代码审不过来？别再把 git diff 直接丢给大模型了,阿里把内部用了两年的 AI 代码审查开源了，GitHub 已经 5 万 Star：文件不漏看，评论精确到行!\n#AI工具 #开源代码 #GitHub #OpenCodeReview https://t.co/uUkI4237cV", "url": "https://x.com/jushixingqiu/status/2122721758403022866"}, {"author_id": "1918972864625328128", "created_at": "2026-11-17T06:27:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122577372012859677"], "id": "2122577372012859677", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 313, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GitHub 每日一推\n今天选中阿里开源的 AI 代码审查工具 alibaba/open-code-review，一周涨了约 2200 星，总星 5.3 万\n\n阿里内部用了两年的代码审查工具开源了，一周涨了2200星，总星5.3万。我拆了下它的README，觉得这东西有点意思。\n\n它叫Open Code", "url": "https://x.com/Jackykow8/status/2122577372012859677"}, {"author_id": "2073019189460434945", "created_at": "2026-11-17T16:53:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122734811194486794"], "id": "2122734811194486794", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 126, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "DeepSeek 突然开始网页限额?\n\n我觉得这个太正常了.  原因可能有这么几个:\n\n1. 之前没有限制的时候,  应该有部分人大规模偷跑网页端流量,  导致算力占用量很大\n\n2.  美国那边算力卡现在开始赌漏洞了,  国内的卡没那么快大规模上.   从这里扣一点算力下来\n\n3. 最近融资了,  资方肯定会问这个问题,", "url": "https://x.com/marsbuildlog/status/2122734811194486794"}, {"author_id": "1967486861460582401", "created_at": "2026-11-17T13:44:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122687427374617046"], "id": "2122687427374617046", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 702, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "高盛——中国互联网与AI模型研究：解读美国针对中国AI模型厂商、云服务商、数据中心的租赁算力访问政策演变带来的影响", "url": "https://x.com/QingFengJianZX/status/2122687427374617046"}, {"author_id": "1852959373108424704", "created_at": "2026-11-17T05:32:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122563540364283905"], "id": "2122563540364283905", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 431, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "高盛——中国互联网与AI模型研究：解读美国针对中国AI模型厂商、云服务商、数据中心的租赁算力访问政策演变带来的影响", "url": "https://x.com/BoosKrabs/status/2122563540364283905"}, {"author_id": "1340444907467661312", "created_at": "2026-11-17T20:36:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122790948132552989"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 56, "id": "1720665183188922368", "start": 51, "username": "grok"}]}, "id": "2122790948132552989", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 165, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "DeepSeek开源把AI价格打下来了，中国大模型不靠烧钱、靠开源弯道超车——\n\n这条路到底能走多远？@grok\n\n美国靠算力封锁，还能不能把差距重新拉开？", "url": "https://x.com/SimonLe99917871/status/2122790948132552989"}, {"author_id": "1995619523148566528", "created_at": "2026-11-17T12:41:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122671397470445595"], "id": "2122671397470445595", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 72, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "其实我在考虑的一个问题，就是本地大模型怎么优化的问题。\n\n如果说我安装了一个本地的大模型，我想优化这个大模型，那么我是不是可以用Claude Code、ChatGPT 等来优化呢？\n\n我认为可行性是有的。", "url": "https://x.com/imalankai/status/2122671397470445595"}, {"author_id": "2071507255976210433", "created_at": "2026-11-17T02:35:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122518944858956266"], "id": "2122518944858956266", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 80, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🔥 又挖到一个 GitHub 王炸项目：FreeLLMAPI！\n\n还在为各种 AI 大模型的 API 费用发愁吗？\n\n最近发现一个非常实用的开源项目 FreeLLMAPI，目前已获得超过 53K Stars。\n\n它最大的亮点，就是把不同平台提供的免费 AI API 整合到一起，让开发者通过一个统一接口调用多个大模型。\n\n🚀 项目核心功能：\n\n* 🤖", "url": "https://x.com/iMicodex/status/2122518944858956266"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122523294586777600", "3_2122523295081713664", "3_2122523295002075136", "3_2122523295346040832"]}, "author_id": "1448826880765808642", "created_at": "2026-11-17T02:52:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122523298084876356"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 245, "start": 222, "url": "https://t.co/xPmrKRJ7PI"}]}, "id": "2122523298084876356", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 262, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122392225908924604", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "开源·产品·AI ·今日速览\n\n【开源】\n\n• https://t.co/ezLk5toXmj：DeepSeek Harness（dsh）社区插件目录，可浏览、发布并自动发现插件（https://t.co/CGSykXyzml）\n\n• since-dev：找出仓库里即将失效的代码，包括退役的 AI 模型 ID、过期运行时和破坏性依赖变更（https://t.co/EGqWpFIiVN）\n\n• https://t.co/09HBimpw4h https://t.co/xPmrKRJ7PI", "url": "https://x.com/binbin_eth/status/2122523298084876356"}, {"author_id": "2202853256", "created_at": "2026-11-17T01:13:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122498251933036572"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 111, "start": 88, "url": "https://t.co/C18CbHZcGy"}]}, "id": "2122498251933036572", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 10836, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122323129334976757", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "如果按照此规则计算，相当于27台B300服务器。依赖海外算力训练的国产开源大模型将是一场渡劫，当然了这 5 个国家是不是听信于美国，这可能是一场外交博弈，上有政策，下有对策！ https://t.co/C18CbHZcGy", "url": "https://x.com/tuolaji2024/status/2122498251933036572"}, {"author_id": "843693085611630592", "created_at": "2026-11-17T14:41:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122701692458451203"], "id": "2122701692458451203", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 318, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "好神奇啊 ！ \ndeepseek、 chatgpt 、claude code 、gemini 。。。 这些AI大模型的主网竟然都没有广告！", "url": "https://x.com/voidJan/status/2122701692458451203"}, {"author_id": "2046631327466958848", "created_at": "2026-11-17T01:50:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122507550109364282"], "id": "2122507550109364282", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 189, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "很多人还在天天争论哪个大模型跑分更高，\n却没看懂这一波 AI 巨头大洗牌背后最真实的逻辑：\n\n以前大家比的是谁的算法更聪明，\n现在比的是谁能熬死对手、谁的口袋更深。\n\n当免费开源模型把基础能力打成白菜价，\n那些靠融资讲故事、每天烧掉几千万美金算力成本的独角兽，\n突然发现自己陷入了一个死局——", "url": "https://x.com/no_reply88/status/2122507550109364282"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122634755003084800"]}, "author_id": "1858777028688039936", "created_at": "2026-11-17T10:24:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122637037086154819"], "id": "2122637037086154819", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 44, "impression_count": 10382, "like_count": 66, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 20, "retweet_count": 13}, "text": "我一直不看好人形机器人短期商业化，但苹果上周这篇论文，让我看到了一个很有希望的方向。\n买来的机器人，背着Mac mini，用开源千问当大脑，在6个陌生家庭完成钻桌底、推箱子、坐椅子等动作，成功率91%。\n而且训练没用一条真人示范数据，1000个虚拟家庭、300小时合成数据，全靠算力生成。 https://t.co/xgslIOm2tz", "url": "https://x.com/FuSheng_0306/status/2122637037086154819"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122507881916321793", "3_2122507882352537600", "3_2122507882117652480", "3_2122507882344132609"]}, "author_id": "1523353770285219840", "created_at": "2026-11-17T01:52:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122508196937916569"], "id": "2122508196937916569", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 226, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ArcaneMatrix · AI 早报 11/17\n\n要闻\n• 阿里巴巴发布 Qwen4-Max：官方称成本降 58%\n• 腾讯混元推出 Hy4 flash，官方称迄今最高性价比\n• Antigravity 上下文窗口翻倍，压缩次数大减\n• OpenAI 启动嵌入式评估，引入外部机构审查安全\n\n开发生态\n• Tibo：Codex 容量报错或已修复\n• Claude Code 适配 https://t.co/P1rsHuLSK6", "url": "https://x.com/arcanematrix/status/2122508196937916569"}, {"author_id": "1890749643325341696", "created_at": "2026-11-17T03:18:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122529833326723096"], "id": "2122529833326723096", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 9626, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 27, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "大部分人在Gemini 订阅后发现一个有意思的现象：\n\n大家非要冒着封号风险去研究反代？\n\n1 原来大家早习惯了 Claude Code、Codex Cursor这类顺手的客户端\n\n2  Google 家庭组能把一个 Ultra 会员的额度裂变共享给多个家庭成员小号 有极高的算力上限。用“家庭组小号 +", "url": "https://x.com/ChuckBass8808/status/2122529833326723096"}, {"author_id": "1473747944704667648", "created_at": "2026-11-17T05:21:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122560642762551356"], "id": "2122560642762551356", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 360, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "鹰派自掘坟墓\n\n过去两年，全世界的财经分析师都在猜，这轮吹到天上的几万亿美元 AI 大基建泡沫，最后到底会怎么破？\n有人猜是因为美国电网带不动、数据中心严重缺电；有人猜是因为大模型根本赚不到钱，巨头们烧不动了；还有人猜是因为华尔街利息太高，把借高利贷买显卡的算力云公司给逼破产了。", "url": "https://x.com/mengyinbeiyong/status/2122560642762551356"}, {"author_id": "1566257458682929152", "created_at": "2026-11-18T00:19:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122847226225623328"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 167, "start": 144, "url": "https://t.co/QSx5wQtmht"}]}, "id": "2122847226225623328", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122524378185507159", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "王长鸟分析：黄仁勋下台叠加美国新芯片法案，下月起中国或断供海外算力卡，东南亚百万卡集群面临切断。华为阻断H200如今反噬；等国产替代放量，美国AI已拉开代差。过去几年撑起中国大模型的是英伟达，昇腾单卡算力低、HBM良率差，集群一断，下一代大模型路径恐被堵死。算力与国产替代成关键。#AI https://t.co/QSx5wQtmht", "url": "https://x.com/lynlng40217191/status/2122847226225623328"}, {"author_id": "1935911364268376071", "created_at": "2026-11-17T03:51:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122538179488342248"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 169, "start": 146, "url": "https://t.co/YvrSryEQmd"}]}, "id": "2122538179488342248", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 561, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122536071020130681", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "闭源模型未来会消失，\n如果大模型没法变成基础设施的话，\n我和其他人的观察不同，\n如果还是把闭源模型变成小圈子的玩法，\n这真是完全不理解。\n梁文峰开源模型和app，\n不是因为慈善，\n是看到了这个路径，\n出售api，成为基础设施，\n美国的的算力困境会很快来临，\n没有足够的电力支持，\n你没看错。 https://t.co/YvrSryEQmd", "url": "https://x.com/gpsma2025/status/2122538179488342248"}, {"author_id": "2091082349702471680", "created_at": "2026-11-17T14:29:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122698539742502914"], "id": "2122698539742502914", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 331, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI 竞争已经上升到国家之间的竞争了，既然国产大模型都缺算力，为什么不发挥一下社会主义特色，集中力量办大事呢？\n\n阿里手握数万台 H 系列、上万台 B 系列，再把国内其他大厂的算力集中起来，反正Qwen也拉了，不如交给 DeepSeek 训练大模型。\n\n举全国之力，打造一个能与", "url": "https://x.com/Stargridcompass/status/2122698539742502914"}, {"author_id": "1576550432523964417", "created_at": "2026-11-17T01:24:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122501192324730979"], "id": "2122501192324730979", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 461, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI行业热点新闻\n1. 阿里发布新一代基座大模型Qwen4-Max：单任务成本降58% 🔥", "url": "https://x.com/web3open/status/2122501192324730979"}, {"author_id": "1850468378949115904", "created_at": "2026-11-17T09:38:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122625289742414136"], "id": "2122625289742414136", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 221, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "🔥海外算力大限将至，国产大模型面临“断粮”危机！", "url": "https://x.com/2008456abc/status/2122625289742414136"}, {"author_id": "2027269541173370880", "created_at": "2026-11-17T14:40:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122701335774810261"], "id": "2122701335774810261", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "逻辑是，现在用任何一家大模型，去做市场探索，哪怕是验证了做好一个demo 相当于 可以直接IPO。\n\n建议各大模型公司 成立算力基金做这个各种扶持 最重要的是验证商业模型。", "url": "https://x.com/yingbidefanmian/status/2122701335774810261"}, {"author_id": "1857474007119118336", "created_at": "2026-11-17T14:02:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122691864092680581"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 89, "start": 66, "url": "https://t.co/f5vVIN0IGh"}]}, "id": "2122691864092680581", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 114, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122546152520421597", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "我有些悲观，但是最近发生的的一系列事件预示着这可能就是这场AI战争目前的走向。开源模型在最近半年的堡垒对战全都败下阵来，无一幸免。 https://t.co/f5vVIN0IGh", "url": "https://x.com/Theodore121388/status/2122691864092680581"}], "includes": {"media": [{"height": 1200, "media_key": "3_2122718327667830784", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXVpEobaMAAc_Kl.jpg", "width": 3000}, {"height": 1800, "media_key": "3_2122719095158390784", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXVpxTjawAAGOCe.jpg", "width": 3200}, {"height": 1800, "media_key": "3_2122719153610174464", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXVp0tTaMAAGgQD.jpg", "width": 3200}, {"height": 1800, "media_key": "3_2122719037331492864", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXVpt8IaUAAZtb9.jpg", "width": 3200}, {"height": 1800, "media_key": "3_2122718900056141824", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXVpl8vasAAqOqm.jpg", "width": 3200}, {"height": 1800, "media_key": "3_2122718974219808768", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXVpqRBacAAHP_V.jpg", "width": 3200}, {"alt_text": "Zoom Slides: AI presentation maker by Zoom", "height": 512, "media_key": "3_2122523294586777600", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXS3sNlWMAA11fB.jpg", "width": 1024}, {"alt_text": "Boost.space AgentOS: specialized AI agents for business roles", "height": 630, "media_key": "3_2122523295081713664", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXS3sPbWUAAWrvj.jpg", "width": 1200}, {"alt_text": "readywhen: personal assistant for hands-on business owners", "height": 630, "media_key": "3_2122523295002075136", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXS3sPIXIAAWIgm.jpg", "width": 1200}, {"alt_text": "AITrustList: AI tools directory ranked by traffic and growth", "height": 630, "media_key": "3_2122523295346040832", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXS3sQaXoAAyrjN.jpg", "width": 1200}, {"duration_ms": 263222, "height": 1920, "media_key": "13_2122634755003084800", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2122634755003084800/img/8KEsNHpRgb_GsEzC.jpg", "type": "video", "variants": [{"content_type": "application/x-mpegURL", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2122634755003084800/pl/vbI70RzdvA5ZHYwA.m3u8?v=7f3"}, {"bit_rate": 632000, "content_type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2122634755003084800/vid/avc1/320x568/wBotJyNyKtjT0oMk.mp4"}, {"bit_rate": 950000, "content_type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2122634755003084800/vid/avc1/480x852/OHbmevkma0A5eYEu.mp4"}, {"bit_rate": 10368000, "content_type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2122634755003084800/vid/avc1/1080x1920/TSIpWCrNGyqO8w5G.mp4"}, {"bit_rate": 2176000, "content_type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2122634755003084800/vid/avc1/720x1280/9Q_yQwmLYeP3fZJ7.mp4"}], "width": 1080}, {"height": 1350, "media_key": "3_2122507881916321793", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXSprE6W0AEq4eT.jpg", "width": 1080}, {"height": 1350, "media_key": "3_2122507882352537600", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXSprGiW8AAFylc.jpg", "width": 1080}, {"height": 1350, "media_key": "3_2122507882117652480", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXSprFqW4AAZLf6.jpg", "width": 1080}, {"height": 1350, "media_key": "3_2122507882344132609", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXSprGgWsAEx9Yd.jpg", "width": 1080}], "tweets": [{"author_id": "800854096219471872", "created_at": "2026-11-16T18:11:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122392225908924604"], "id": "2122392225908924604", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 77, "impression_count": 19023, "like_count": 246, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 40, "retweet_count": 18}, "text": "Today we’re launching Databricks AI Index, based on data from 10,000+ enterprises using our Unity Gateway.\n\nKey findings:\n- OSS models are gaining serious market share. Their token share jumped from 7.3% to 30.9% in just 3.5 months, more than 4X.\n- Enterprises are going"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122323081587032065", "3_2122323106731905024"]}, "author_id": "2202853256", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:37:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122323129334976757"], "id": "2122323129334976757", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 28, "impression_count": 53235, "like_count": 57, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "美国商务部工业与安全局(BIS)发布了一项新规，封堵远程访问，把出口管制的覆盖范围从‘芯片卖到哪里’扩展到了‘算力租给谁’。\n\n境外数据中心只要向中国等 D:5 国家总部企业提供超过 1200 万 aggregate TPP（总处理性能，芯片算力的计量口径）的算力，折合约 758 张 https://t.co/ifWIODAvZO"}, {"author_id": "1773757013631393792", "created_at": "2026-11-17T02:57:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122524378185507159"], "id": "2122524378185507159", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 282, "impression_count": 368248, "like_count": 1235, "quote_count": 22, "reply_count": 374, "retweet_count": 107}, "text": "老黄走了，新法案落地了，从下个月开始，中国彻底没有海外的卡用了。所有的国模的训练都有可能会暂停，东南亚的百万卡的中国集群要彻底被切断了，无论是H100,H200+，还B200,B300+。当年华为为了一己之私，强行阻断了本来两国都已经批准的H200进口，拍着胸脯说自己能供给上，现在彻底被卡了。等华为明年"}, {"author_id": "1935911364268376071", "created_at": "2026-11-17T03:43:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122536071020130681"], "id": "2122536071020130681", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 440, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "五年前抢充电站的人，五年后都在抢算力。\n记得几年前私人资本疯投充电站的场面吗？\n接下来五年，芯片和大模型领域，\n原样复刻一遍。\n想上车的，记住一条路：\n别当玩家，当服务员——\n练好技术，进去给资本干活。\n国内有的是底牌：\n小水电、光伏，遍地都是。\n电在，算力就在。\n风口每五年换一次，"}, {"author_id": "2061068428430168065", "created_at": "2026-11-17T04:23:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122546152520421597"], "id": "2122546152520421597", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 3462, "like_count": 29, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 17, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "留个中国大模型的时间不多了\n\n如果最近一次发布的模型超越不了 Claude Opus 5.5 \n\n那估计只能3年后再见\n\n老美全面收紧海外AI高端芯片，原来芯片进不来还可以用海外机房，现在连海外机房这条路都走不了\n\n现在只能用遥遥领先的芯片，价格更贵、还要进行适配、产能也不一定更上"}], "users": [{"id": "1977291220276957184", "name": "明子206", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2079413882003857408/u7656aWy_normal.jpg", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 8694, "following_count": 3602, "like_count": 11522, "listed_count": 39, "media_count": 238, "tweet_count": 8954}, "username": "mingzi206", "verified": false}, {"id": "2027925365415677959", "name": "王长川", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2117525857606713344/HazyCkN7_normal.jpg", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 11310, "following_count": 7150, "like_count": 23090, "listed_count": 29, "media_count": 130, "tweet_count": 16185}, "username": "changchuan888", "verified": false}, {"id": "1847963625325268992", "name": "数字游民", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1935705579164442625/sVQljq82_normal.jpg", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 35, "following_count": 14, "like_count": 15, "listed_count": 0, "media_count": 9, "tweet_count": 82}, "username": "jushixingqiu", "verified": false}, {"id": "1918972864625328128", "name": "AI热点速报 | AI Hot Daily", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2115330551133736960/Drl2w8DS_normal.jpg", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 3670, "following_count": 3442, "like_count": 7410, "listed_count": 0, "media_count": 128, "tweet_count": 5546}, "username": "Jackykow8", "verified": false}, {"id": "2073019189460434945", "name": "码老师造物记", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2073035742981537792/Vt_XIZO0_normal.jpg", "public_metrics": {"followers_count": 8404, "following_count": 7500, "like_count": 157, "listed_count": 